WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
If you want my help through the entire process of getting your college essays ready from writing

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.720
your Common App essay to completing your supplementals, then this is the right package

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:14.320
for you. I got into every single college I applied to with over $600,000 in scholarships

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.120
and a full tuition scholarship to Vanderbilt, and I've taught that same strategy to help

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.600
over a thousand students now write amazing college essays that have gotten them into great

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:30.400
schools like Penn, UC Berkeley with scholarship, Dartmouth, Cornell, Rice, NYU with full tuition

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.960
scholarship twice, and I would love to help you too. Here's how this package works. We'll start

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.880
with your Common App essay. If you're just starting from scratch, I will help you from

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:44.160
the very beginning to brainstorm ideas, figure out which of them is your best, create a detailed

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:49.120
outline for the best idea, help you add in the right kinds of details to your essay, and help

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:54.320
you refine it and polish it until it is ready to go and will 100% move the needle in a positive

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.720
direction for you. Then after that, we'll use the remaining calls that we have to work through your

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:03.680
supplementals for your colleges. I have worked with so many students on supplementals and so I

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:09.200
can help you with all of the big supplemental essays like your Y major essay, your YS essay,

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:14.000
the community essays, and more. I have worked with so many students on the school-specific

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.280
prompts, so I know exactly how to make those school-specific supplementals stand out, and that's

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:23.920
what I'm going to help you do. We are going to make sure that your supplementals are polished,

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:29.120
unique, have good hooks, etc., and by the time you finish this package, your Common App should be

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:33.760
ready to go, as well as most of your supplementals, which will be an amazing feeling. You will have

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:38.400
everything that you need to have both of them done. Finally, we can also work on your activity

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:43.600
list if we still have time remaining. So how do the calls work? Each call is a live 30-minute

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:48.480
one-on-one session with me. I don't have a team. I do all of the calls myself, and I'll be helping

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:53.840
you through every single step of the process. And you will also get unlimited email support

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.080
in between every single call to make sure that you're never stuck or second-guessing what

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:02.240
you're supposed to be working on or what you're supposed to do. We can space out the sessions

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:06.720
however you need. Most students do one call a week, but if you have tight deadlines, we can

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:11.680
definitely do multiple calls a week or schedule them however you need it. This package is meant to

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:17.760
make everything easier on you. The whole process should be so much less painful when you have the

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:22.160
package, because you will know what to do every single step of the way. That is the goal. If you'd

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:27.920
rather not schedule calls, I also have a written, edits-only version of the same package. But if

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:32.480
you're ready to get started working one-on-one with me, I am so excited to work with you. Email

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.960
me at avigallangatgmail.com if you have any questions before booking, and otherwise you

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.720
can book right here on this page.
